# corbell's own workspace (recreated by `corbell init` on demand — the adapter's
# INIT GUARD runs the init only when workspace.yaml is ABSENT, so deleting it is safe
# and committing it is wrong: it holds a live workspace.db + journal)
corbell-data/

# the ripwire cwd-jail symlink (session tooling, not project content)
gi-project

# ★ AUDIT FRAUD 2 FIXED (2026-09-23): the zero-trust audit found 92 MB of generated stores
# COMMITTED (kg.json 181k lines, .ua 100k lines, 20 tracked sqlite files / 85 MB) because these
# four dirs were never ignored and `git add -A` swept them in. They are INGEST OUTPUTS, not source.
