.arsumbris/

# ★ R19 hygiene: SQLite WAL/SHM sidecars are RUNTIME artifacts — they appear on every store
# read and vanish on checkpoint. Tracked, they churn the status line and can be committed
# half-written (a torn sidecar beside a clean db is worse than no sidecar at all).
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
